# Build context trimming — keep the image small and the build fast.
# Bare AND globbed: Docker's matcher does NOT reliably exclude a top-level dir
# with only `**/foo`, so list both (the monorepo root node_modules is ~1GB and
# was bloating the context to 1.1GB+ / 10min "transferring context").
node_modules
**/node_modules
.next
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/dist
**/out
# A separate project's SQLite DBs living under the repo (see the storage note) —
# never part of the image.
odysseus
**/*.db
**/*.sqlite
# Build INPUT only (the derived land-50m.json ships; the raw topo does not).
apps/web/public/geo/countries-50m.topo.json
**/coverage
**/.vercel
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
**/e2e/.proof
**/*.log
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
.git
**/.git
.github
_parked
obra-superpowers
_superpowers
# The cloned superpowers skill repos + scratch dirs each carry a full .git —
# they were bloating the build context past 150MB. None are needed in the image.
.claude
testytest
odysseus
mcp-servers
docs
**/.DS_Store
**/*.pid
**/.jobs-dev.pid
apps/desktop
apps/mobile
